### 3.5 Cursor（未来）

```yaml
platform: cursor
transport: role-switch

dispatch:
  implementation: prompt_role_switch
  notes: "提示用户切换到对应角色，新对话中执行 Task"

review:
  implementation: prompt_role_switch
  notes: "提示用户切换为 Reviewer 角色"

capabilities:
  parallel: false
  filesystem: full
  shell: full
  subagent: false
